# What `make fixtures` reads from a device, one source per line:
#   file PATH           the file, or every file the glob matches (unreadable ones are skipped)
#   ubus OBJECT METHOD [ARGS]   the reply, saved as ubus/OBJECT.METHOD.json
file /proc/loadavg
ubus system board
ubus network.wireless status
ubus hostapd.phy0-ap0 get_status
ubus hostapd.phy0-ap0 get_clients
ubus hostapd.phy1-ap0 get_status
ubus hostapd.phy1-ap0 get_clients
ubus hostapd.phy1-ap1 get_status
ubus hostapd.phy1-ap1 get_clients
# Not captured: test/fixtures/<device>/nl80211/NL80211_CMD_<CMD>.<dev>.json are
# the replies of ucode-mod-nl80211's request() on the device (GET requests only),
# printed with %.J. test/fixtures/synthetic/ holds replies no device here has:
# ubus/dawn.get_network.json is laid out as DAWN's build_network_overview()
# (src/utils/ubus.c, DAWN 7414c34) writes it.
